# Open with the VS Code REST Client extension and click "Send Request".
# Keep this file at the project root so REST Client can load .env.
# ADMIN_API_KEY is read from .env; never paste the key into this file.
# Change the date below. Dates must be today or earlier (Asia/Kolkata).
@date = 2026-10-19
@baseUrl = https://gospel-instagram-publisher.amal-c-babu457.workers.dev

### Publish missing items immediately for this date
# Existing jobs are skipped. Media must already be uploaded to R2.
# Choose any combination of "story", "post", and "reel".
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/backfill
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{date}}",
  "to": "{{date}}",
  "types": ["story", "post", "reel"]
}

### Preview missing items without publishing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/backfill
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{date}}",
  "to": "{{date}}",
  "types": ["story", "post", "reel"],
  "preview": true
}
